  { title: 'Review returns and warranty', text: 'The current official store advertises a 45-day return period and a lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects. Read the full policy before purchase.' },
  { title: 'Check the checkout total', text: 'Confirm coupon eligibility, shipping, taxes, exclusions and final price at checkout; promotional terms and product availability can change.' }
];

const faqs = [
  { question: 'What does HOSHANHO sell?', answer: 'HOSHANHO’s official store features individual kitchen knives, multi-piece knife sets, knife blocks and magnetic storage, plus other kitchen accessories. Its assortment is organized by knife type, series and set size.' },
  { question: 'Are there HOSHANHO coupon codes?', answer: 'The official Black Friday page currently lists BF20, BF35, BF50, BF85 and BF130. Each code has a different minimum spend, ranging from $175 to $600. The highest eligible tier applies, and the official page says the codes apply storewide, including bundles. Confirm the terms at checkout.' },
