  { question: 'What is HOSHANHO’s return and warranty policy?', answer: 'The official Black Friday page advertises 45-day returns and a lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects. Review the retailer’s current Returns & Exchanges and warranty terms for exclusions and instructions.' },
  { question: 'How should HOSHANHO knives be cleaned?', answer: 'The product listings recommend hand-washing and drying thoroughly immediately after use, then storing the knife in a dry environment. Follow the care instructions for the exact model.' },
  { question: 'Does Buy Better Finds personally test every HOSHANHO product?', answer: 'No. This brand page is a research-based buying guide using publicly available brand and product information. It does not claim hands-on testing of every product.' }
